55</fpage><lpage>661</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12407350</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mangia</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Villani</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Cappucci</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Santoro</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ricciardi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Facciorusso</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Leandro</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Caruso</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Andriulli</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Causes of portal venous thrombosis in cirrhotic patients: the role of genetic and acquired factors</article-title><source>Eur J Gastroenterol Hepatol</source><year>2005</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>745</fpage><lpage>751</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15947552</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vecchio</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Cacciola</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Cacciola</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Marchese</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Intagliata</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Portal vein thrombosis after laparoscopic and open splenectomy</article-title><source>J Laparoendosc Adv Surg Tech A</source><year>2011</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>75</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21190480</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-